outh; and the Aegean Sea, Greece, and Bulgaria to the west. Turkey is home to over 86 million people; most are ethnic Turks, while Kurds are the largest ethnic minority. Officially a secular state, Turkey has a Muslim-majority population. Ankara is Turkey's capital and second-largest city. Istanbul is its largest city and economic center. Other major cities include İzmir, Bursa, and Antalya.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turkey","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"TR"},{"title":"Azerbaijan","extract":"Azerbaijan, officially the Republic of Azerbaijan, is a landlocked country at the boundary of Western Asia and Eastern Europe. It is a part of the South Caucasus region and is bounded by the Caspian Sea to the east, Russia's republic of Dagestan to the north, Georgia to the northwest, Turkey and Armenia to the west, and Iran to the south. Baku is the capital and largest city.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Azerbaijan","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"AZ"}],"arc":{"reports":5,"first_seen":"2026-10-29T05:13:32Z","first_title":"Erdogan tells Trump Turkey seeks diplomatic solutions on Hormuz and Yemen","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQYkZCX29wNGdPQzl6UklReWpXczRkdVV2MGxDOUhsRmZMU0U2ZzJST1FHWFltLTZRM0FhdENPcjZ0aFBUMW1ZdmFZQWRvNDJ5cWZ2WjE3eHBraVNCcUMxcng3RTdWdEFXR1JZMlpJU3lBcXhIdzAyZzlOaW03UVF5VFgxRWdGZnQ0U3FaUTlkVEhhZWxOT2VqZGR5d01MSWpHRE5aMU1zZw?oc=5","first_publisher":"Middle East Online","earlier":[{"id":"e_fe2fbc305378","title":"Erdogan tells Trump Turkey seeks diplomatic solutions on Hormuz and Yemen","date":"2026-10-29T05:13:32Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQYkZCX29wNGdPQzl6UklReWpXczRkdVV2MGxDOUhsRmZMU0U2ZzJST1FHWFltLTZRM0FhdENPcjZ0aFBUMW1ZdmFZQWRvNDJ5cWZ2WjE3eHBraVNCcUMxcng3RTdWdEFXR1JZMlpJU3lBcXhIdzAyZzlOaW03UVF5VFgxRWdGZnQ0U3FaUTlkVEhhZWxOT2VqZGR5d01MSWpHRE5aMU1zZw?oc=5","publisher":"Middle East Online","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":